# Gold standards

The always-on contract is the pack `AGENTS.md`. Read it once this turn and follow it. Do not invent a weaker checklist. Do not paste its body into this rule.

Stop at the first `AGENTS.md` that contains `gabriel-skills-agents`:

1. `AGENTS.md` at the workspace root
2. `$CODEX_HOME/AGENTS.md` when `CODEX_HOME` is set, otherwise `~/.codex/AGENTS.md`
3. `~/.claude/gabriel-skills/AGENTS.md`
4. The `AGENTS.md` beside `skills/` when this repository is the open workspace
5. The `AGENTS.md` beside the installed plugin's `skills/` folder (Marketplace / Customize install of gabriel-skills)

Skill roots, in order, are `~/.agents/skills/`, `~/.claude/skills/`, `~/.cursor/skills/`, workspace `skills/` when this pack is the open workspace, then the plugin `skills/` folder. Doctrine paths are relative to that root.
